# Controller Rules
- Controllers should define actions (e.g., actionIndex, actionView, actionCreate, actionUpdate, actionDelete, actionAdmin) to handle user requests
- Controllers must extend from the Controller class
- Employ Yii 1.1 built-in access control (filters, accessRules) to secure endpoints and restrict actions based on roles
- Delegate heavy business logic to models or service layers rather than including it in controllers
- Ensure controllers maintain clarity in request handling and response rendering
